---
// Hero 英雄区
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-line load-reveal" data-load-delay="0"></div>
        <p class="hero-pre load-reveal" data-load-delay="100">作品集 · 2026</p>
        <h1 class="hero-name load-reveal" data-load-delay="200">
          钟文清<br><span class="highlight">QT新月</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-role load-reveal" data-load-delay="400">
          <strong>AI / 数据工程 / 全栈开发</strong>。深职大在读，海客熵连科技开发者——
          负责多平台广告数据自动化系统。专注 <strong>Python、TensorFlow、MediaPipe</strong>，用代码解决真实问题。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta load-reveal" data-load-delay="550">
          <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">浏览项目 →</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-ghost">联系我</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual load-reveal" data-load-delay="300">
        <div class="hero-avatar-ring">月</div>
        <span class="hero-floating-tag t1">Python</span>
        <span class="hero-floating-tag t2">TensorFlow</span>
        <span class="hero-floating-tag t3">MediaPipe</span>
        <span class="hero-floating-tag t4">OpenCV</span>
        <span class="hero-floating-tag t5">Playwright</span>
        <span class="hero-floating-tag t6">日本語 N2</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll load-reveal" data-load-delay="700" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>向下滚动</span>
    <div class="scroll-line"></div>
  </div>
</section>
